s:\n            return\n\n        chosen = controller.choose_card(nonland_cards, \"Choose a nonland card to discard\")\n        if chosen is not None:\n            discard(game, target, chosen)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
